{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14枚目シングルの握手会が\n今日、始まりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1回目の握手会から\n本当にたくさんの方に来ていただけて\n嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/16/1440442/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今日\n14日にあった熊本地震を受けて\n募金箱を急遽、設置しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご協力ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも早く復興が進みますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず\nミニライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんと中田で\n影ナレしてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/16/1440442/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握の影ナレとかいつぶりだろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"0Overture\n1ハルジオンが咲く頃\n2急斜面\n-MC-\n3釣り堀\n4憂鬱と風船ガム\n5不等号\n-MC-\n6遥かなるブータン\n7強がる蕾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初披露だった曲も多かったのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、歌ってる楽曲は\n不等号の1曲だけだけど\nすごく好きだから\n4分17秒が楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くメンバー全員で披露できたらなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はあーちゃんと一緒のレーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/16/1440442/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーちゃん可愛い抱